@host = http://localhost:8080

### Prijava dermatologa
# @name derm
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "dermatolog@dermawise.rs", "password": "derm123"}

### Pacijenti sa fototipom, trudnoćom i brojem preporuka na čekanju
GET {{host}}/api/dermatologist/patients
Authorization: Bearer {{derm.response.body.token}}

### Preporuke na recept koje čekaju potvrdu (PENDING_REVIEW), uz oznaku trudnoće
# @name pending
GET {{host}}/api/dermatologist/recommendations/pending
Authorization: Bearer {{derm.response.body.token}}

### Odobravanje prve preporuke na čekanju
POST {{host}}/api/dermatologist/recommendations/{{pending.response.body.$[0].recommendation.id}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{derm.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"comment": "Odobreno, kontrola za 6 nedelja"}

### Odbijanje bez komentara vraća 400
POST {{host}}/api/dermatologist/recommendations/{{pending.response.body.$[1].recommendation.id}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{derm.response.body.token}}

### Odbijanje druge preporuke sa komentarom
POST {{host}}/api/dermatologist/recommendations/{{pending.response.body.$[1].recommendation.id}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{derm.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"comment": "Prvo probati azelainsku kiselinu"}

### Pacijent vidi novi status u svojoj rutini (APPROVED ili REJECTED sa komentarom)
GET {{host}}/api/dermatologist/patients/{{pending.response.body.$[0].patientId}}/analysis
Authorization: Bearer {{derm.response.body.token}}
